{"slug":"01-erster-tag","language":"deu","text":"Ich hatte keine Ahnung, was mich hier erwartet und dann das hier. Ich wollt halt nicht Schule machen, weil das machen ja grad gefühlt alle und ich wollt halt auch was lernen und ich had auch keinen Bock mehr auf Schule, von dem her. Also das Vorstellungsgespräch war eigentlich auf einer Augenhöhe. Der erste Tag war relativ entspannt eigentlich. Hat man die Firma noch mal besser kennengelernt und dann hat man eigentlich auch relativ schnell gestartet, dann auch ins Praktische zu gehen. Da hab ich ja auch schon gemerkt, dass es hier echt 'n lockeres Verhältnis zueinander ist und ist eigentlich wie eine große Familie. Mir hat die Industrie eigentlich gleich zugesagt, die Arbeitsbedingungen und auch das Arbeiten mit Metall. Hat mir von Anfang an Spaß gemacht. Vielleicht ist dein erster Tag ja schon bald. Bewirb dich jetzt.","words":[{"w":"Ich","s":0.28,"e":0.36},{"w":"hatte","s":0.42,"e":0.62},{"w":"keine","s":0.66,"e":0.94},{"w":"Ahnung,","s":1,"e":1.18},{"w":"was","s":1.22,"e":1.34},{"w":"mich","s":1.4,"e":1.52},{"w":"hier","s":1.56,"e":1.66},{"w":"erwartet","s":1.68,"e":2.14},{"w":"und","s":2.32,"e":2.46},{"w":"dann","s":2.48,"e":2.62},{"w":"das","s":2.66,"e":2.86},{"w":"hier.","s":2.88,"e":3.06},{"w":"Ich","s":12.4,"e":12.48},{"w":"wollt","s":12.52,"e":12.7},{"w":"halt","s":12.76,"e":13},{"w":"nicht","s":13.08,"e":13.34},{"w":"Schule","s":13.58,"e":13.8},{"w":"machen,","s":13.86,"e":14.02},{"w":"weil","s":14.06,"e":14.14},{"w":"das","s":14.18,"e":14.26},{"w":"machen","s":14.3,"e":14.42},{"w":"ja","s":14.46,"e":14.5},{"w":"grad","s":14.54,"e":14.7},{"w":"gefühlt","s":14.78,"e":15.04},{"w":"alle","s":15.1,"e":15.28},{"w":"und","s":15.64,"e":15.92},{"w":"ich","s":15.96,"e":16.08},{"w":"wollt","s":16.12,"e":16.32},{"w":"halt","s":16.36,"e":16.46},{"w":"auch","s":16.5,"e":16.6},{"w":"was","s":16.62,"e":16.74},{"w":"lernen","s":16.8,"e":17},{"w":"und","s":17.34,"e":17.46},{"w":"ich","s":17.52,"e":17.58},{"w":"had","s":17.62